'''Midnite D.''' (ミッドナイトナカイ, ''Middonaito Nakai'', '''Midnight Nakai''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Rain D.]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

