==Enemy==
Meet your new worst nightmare. Rain D. may have been annoying with all his knockbacks, but Midnite D. makes those knockbacks terrifying, with a [[Shield]] that regenerates for each and every one of them, able to provide up to another 840,000 health, equaling a nightmarish total of '''1.14 million''' health, which increases even more in higher magnifications. The Shield is relatively weak when compared to others, but the effect builds up due to how many times it could potentially regenerate, each time possibly blocking a devastating hit that would have marked his demise, or stopping a negative effect from being applied, or allowing Midnite D. to attack without being interrupted. And all of that, for just a single Midnite D. Otherwise, he behaves in much the same way as Rain D.

==Strategy==
Normally, [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercing Cats]] would be the best answer to a Shield, but enough brute force can also overwhelm him through sheer weight of fire, though this may take quite a while due to his relative ease in repositioning and tanking hard hits with his multiple regenerating Shields. Due to his relatively low HP (but with a high KB count), the best solution to dealing with him quickly is by either using weaker units to pierce his Shield and timing hard-hitting cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to damage him for a large chunk of his health, or using units who have a guaranteed/high Shield Piercing chance and high damage to hit him hard such as [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]].

[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] is unlocked [[Infernal Tower/Floor 50|late into the game]], but is one of the most potent counters to Midnite D. His [[Strong Against]] gives him great stats against this demonic beast, and thanks to the lingering properties of his [[Surge Attack]], Uril's Surge will first break Midnite D.'s Shield, then [[Slow]] him down. This also makes Uril the best way to control Midnite D., as other options struggle against his constantly-regenerating Shields.

