==Trivia==
*Midnite D. may be named after the color [[wikipedia:Midnight blue|midnight blue]].
*His descriptions reference [[wikipedia:Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer|Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer]].
**While the Japanese description is a direct reference, the English description only references the nose.
*He was technically an event enemy for a short time, as his only appearance at first was in [[Infernal Tower]]. This makes Midnite D. the only enemy introduced in Infernal Tower to:
**Appear elsewhere in the game.
**Have a description.
**Not be a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]].
**Not have the Curse effect.
**Not be obtainable as the [[True Form]] of a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]].
*Midnite D. appears to stand farther back than [[Rain D.]], but this is purely visual, as both of them have 300 range.

